Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:55.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}願望如夢般短暫{\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:57.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}但人生很長
